@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Authorization decision and enforcement flow
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:PEP: resolve verified current actor / credential context\nand exact resource + action;
:PDP role: evaluate current account eligibility, scoped policy / grants;
if (Known applicable permission established?) then (yes)
 :Resource owner checks current lifecycle / operation invariant;
 if (Actual guarded admission conditions satisfied?) then (yes)
  :Allow only exact intended operation / projection;
 else (no)
  :Safe deny / conflict;
 endif
else (no / unresolved)
 :Safe deny; no private disclosure;
endif
:Record bounded attributable result and policy provenance;
stop

@enduml